{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1793574365,"nonce":"JUCjUpObBrznMGDaebQWC87EUv4=","message":"Swipe follow-ups from owner testing: (1) two-finger/Magic Mouse swipe = horizontal scroll; added Div::on_scroll_x (engine) so the days take horizontal scroll only and vertical passes to the page (dispatch_scroll_chain skips a horizontal-only handler for mostly-vertical deltas). (2) 'only the first swipe works until the mouse leaves and re-enters': the gesture's quiet gap was a scheduler keyframe, which an idle window never ticks; leaving/entering caused hover frames that ticked it. Now wall clock (web_time) between scroll events. (3) Harness now mirrors the window: drags during a press take on_mouse_drag_fast, leave() calls on_mouse_leave (releases a press, clears hover). cn_switch_on_idle/on_hover goldens re-blessed: the old ones were recorded with a dangling press; the new ones equal a freshly mounted switch. Open: the month does not follow the fingers during a swipe (needs scroll phase in EventContext to snap back on lift); asked the owner whether that is what 'glide' meant. Combobox/select trigger labels no_wrap + side padding only (owner screenshot: 'Japa/n' clipped).","files":null}]}